{"actor":{"id":"GRD","name":"Grenada","type":"state","iso2":"gd","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grenada","coords":[-61.75,12.05],"seat":"St. George's","regions":["central-america-caribbean"],"card":"stub","tier":"minor","last_verified":"2026-10-16","dataset":"wikidata","grand_strategy":{"objectives":[{"rank":1,"text":"Get Carriacou and Petite Martinique back on their feet after Hurricane Beryl (landfall 1 July 2024). Prime Minister Dickon Mitchell warned before landfall that Carriacou would take extreme damage and afterwards called the destruction there severe, with ninety percent of buildings reported destroyed (the figure as attributed in press reports to a CARICOM summit report, not yet checked against that report).","confidence":"C","sources":[{"url":"https://jamaicaobserver.com/2024/07/01/hurricane-beryl-grenada-pm-anticipates-extreme-damage-carriacou","title":"Hurricane Beryl: Grenada PM anticipates extreme damage on Carriacou (title taken from the URL; page not opened)","publisher":"Jamaica Observer","date":"2024-07-01","tier":3},{"url":"https://caribbeantoday.com/fr/sections/environment/three-dead-after-hurricane-beryl-passes-through-grenada","title":"Three Dead After Hurricane Beryl Passes Through Grenada","publisher":"Caribbean Today","date":"2024-07","tier":3}]},{"rank":2,"text":"Keep the CARICOM partners as the first call for relief and security support. Before landfall Mitchell said he was in constant contact with his CARICOM colleagues, who were ready to offer relief and security support; afterwards he asked neighbouring states for a helicopter.","confidence":"C","sources":[{"url":"https://caribbeantoday.com/fr/sections/environment/three-dead-after-hurricane-beryl-passes-through-grenada","title":"Three Dead After Hurricane Beryl Passes Through Grenada","publisher":"Caribbean Today","date":"2024-07","tier":3},{"url":"https://www.guardian.co.tt/news/grenada-pm-three-dead-when-hurricane-beryl-made-landfall-in-grenada-6.2.2042078.82a01658d9","title":"Grenada PM: three dead when Hurricane Beryl made landfall in Grenada","publisher":"Guardian (Trinidad and Tobago)","date":"2024-07","tier":3}]}],"means":[{"text":"Regional mutual aid, in kind: the relief and security support promised by CARICOM colleagues and a helicopter requested from neighbours after landfall. The sources read do not say which states sent what, so this is a request and a promise, not a delivered capacity.","confidence":"C","sources":[{"url":"https://jamaicaobserver.com/2024/07/01/hurricane-beryl-grenada-pm-anticipates-extreme-damage-carriacou","title":"Hurricane Beryl: Grenada PM anticipates extreme damage on Carriacou (title taken from the URL; page not opened)","publisher":"Jamaica Observer","date":"2024-07-01","tier":3},{"url":"https://www.guardian.co.tt/news/grenada-pm-three-dead-when-hurricane-beryl-made-landfall-in-grenada-6.2.2042078.82a01658d9","title":"Grenada PM: three dead when Hurricane Beryl made landfall in Grenada","publisher":"Guardian (Trinidad and Tobago)","date":"2024-07","tier":3}]}],"constraints":[{"text":"Exposed outer islands. Beryl killed three people across Grenada and Carriacou and left Carriacou with most of its buildings destroyed, so one storm can take away the reach of a small state's economy in a single season.","confidence":"C","sources":[{"url":"https://caribbeantoday.com/fr/sections/environment/three-dead-after-hurricane-beryl-passes-through-grenada","title":"Three Dead After Hurricane Beryl Passes Through Grenada","publisher":"Caribbean Today","date":"2024-07","tier":3}]}],"paradoxes":[],"reading":"Grenada's strategy, as far as the sources read show it, is small-state survival through the regional bloc: CARICOM partners are its first call for relief and security, and its own means are a request for a helicopter and a storm-battered outer island. The one hard fact the sources give is the scale of Beryl's damage on Carriacou, which makes recovery, not foreign policy, the binding constraint of 2024-26. Confidence C throughout: only press summaries of July 2024 were read, so the United States, China, the United Kingdom, the CARICOM chairmanship, the citizenship-by-investment scheme, the nutmeg and tourism economy and the paradox are still open and unwritten.\n"}},"stances":[],"stances_toward":[],"relations_from":[{"from":"GRD","to":"XKX","layer":"alignment","type":"recognition","summary":"Recognises Kosovo since 2013-09-25.","since":"2013-09-25","until":null,"last_verified":"2026-10-12","confidence":"B","dataset":"wikipedia-recognition","sources":[{"url":"https://telegrafi.com/grenada-njeh-kosoven/","title":"Citation under the Kosovo row in Wikipedia's list (GRD)","publisher":"as cited by Wikipedia","date":"2013-09-25","tier":3,"dataset":"wikipedia-recognition"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=International_recognition_of_Kosovo&oldid=1378445352","title":"International recognition of Kosovo","publisher":"Wikipedia (index)","date":"2026-10-12","tier":4,"dataset":"wikipedia-recognition"}],"stale":false},{"from":"GRD","to":"PSE","layer":"alignment","type":"recognition","summary":"Recognises the State of Palestine since 2011-09-25.","since":"2011-09-25","until":null,"last_verified":"2026-10-12","confidence":"C","dataset":"wikipedia-recognition","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=International_recognition_of_Palestine&oldid=1378300905","title":"International recognition of Palestine","publisher":"Wikipedia (index)","date":"2026-10-12","tier":4,"dataset":"wikipedia-recognition"}],"stale":false},{"from":"GRD","to":"TWN","layer":"alignment","type":"non_recognition","summary":"Does not recognise the Republic of China (Taiwan).","since":null,"until":null,"last_verified":"2026-10-12","confidence":"C","dataset":"wikipedia-recognition","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Foreign_relations_of_Taiwan&oldid=1378208098","title":"Foreign relations of Taiwan","publisher":"Wikipedia (index)","date":"2026-10-12","tier":